  "headline": "Ceftriaxone sodium is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; internal supply shows Corvale Lakeside at 8.8 days on hand for 1 g injection",
  "headline_cites": ["D5", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show ceftriaxone sodium is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 37 vials of the 1 g injection with 4.2 vials used per day, giving 8.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 253 vials at 12.9 vials per day for 19.6 days on hand, and Corvale General holds 298 vials at 15.8 vials per day for 18.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "All three sites use product labeled by REMEDYREPACK INC. (NDC 70518249900) manufactured by SANDOZ.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E3", "E4", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternate manufacturer option from Civica, Inc. uses Hikma Farmacêutica (Portugal), which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Proficient Rx LP, a relabeler for a different NDC, has a registered plant inspected by FDA with VAI classifications in 2015 and 2022.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E7", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked internal action is to transfer 22 vials of 1 g from Corvale East to Corvale Lakeside, which would raise Lakeside to 14 days on hand while East retains two weeks.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    }
  ]
}
